#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:5
#: 8df398d6f4ad4318a97ce6911fdea2b8
msgid "Waypoints"
msgstr "航点"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:7
#: d666f47300e54c6ea7ddc4eb6ffd5973
msgid ""
"MAVProxy includes a few commands for managing waypoints. These can be "
"entered via the command line or via the menu bar of the GUI console."
msgstr "MAVProxy 包含若干用于管理航点的命令，可通过命令行或GUI控制台菜单栏输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:11
#: 50edc6b06a76458596017ce81f00e34f
msgid "wp list"
msgstr "wp list"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:13
#: 801e57c1c76d4a9188f1299b8b6e09fe
msgid "View the currently loaded waypoints on the autopilot."
msgstr "查看飞控上当前加载的航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:16
#: 1ab6ca78771542cea3ed1d47d7379ce6
msgid "wp load"
msgstr "wp load"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:18
#: 4f0dc1882b8c48498fc8c1561b80cc94
msgid "Load a new set of waypoints from file."
msgstr "从文件加载新的航点集合。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:25
#: 283fd8ee2eb34764b6e1ed34b6db2172
msgid "wp save"
msgstr "wp save"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:27
#: 22c4fcc235bd4527b2bc939c29ce8d93
msgid "Save the set of current waypoints to file."
msgstr "将当前航点集合保存到文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:34
#: f49231537fdb4241847a76342720d13e
msgid "wp clear"
msgstr "wp clear"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:36
#: 3c144515558d41e58e9af5a7f50a1b8c
msgid ""
"Delete all waypoints from the autopilot. It is not recommended to do this "
"during an AUTO mission."
msgstr "从飞控中删除所有航点。不建议在AUTO任务执行期间进行此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:40
#: b4e7574df03648b78ed582f148abc6c6
msgid "wp update"
msgstr "wp update"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:42
#: 18ee2e77aa5a47ce874282b4efae9be6
msgid ""
"Similar to ``wp load``, except only a single specified waypoint is loaded."
msgstr "与 ``wp load`` 类似，但仅加载指定的单个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:50
#: 41c21ee432184a9b952fd82d4bb954eb
msgid "wp move"
msgstr "wp move"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:52
#: e30037196f814a6c9550f50ce8923c6b
msgid ""
"Move a specific waypoint to a new location. When entered, a new location can"
" be selected on the map window. If a DTED map is available, the AGL height "
"of the waypoint will be maintained. This requires the map module to be "
"loaded."
msgstr "将特定航点移动到新位置。输入命令后，可在地图窗口中选择新位置。若有DTED地图，航点的AGL高度将保持不变。此操作需要加载地图模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:62
#: 0b2203be75224651b4613851683cc25e
msgid "wp loop"
msgstr "wp loop"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:64
#: 72fececc35784491823cd0b17a2209b3
msgid ""
"Closes the loop on a mission, allowing the autopilot to repeat a mission."
msgstr "闭合任务循环，允许飞控重复执行任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:67
#: ec7eec59df4a461ea1dc2cf4ef2345d3
msgid "wp remove"
msgstr "wp remove"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:69
#: 335c5cfe1caa4e8b827ee45a7092abe4
msgid "Remove a specific waypoint from the mission."
msgstr "从任务中删除特定航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:76
#: 30c99a44ef534bad86112e9b9a05fbc5
msgid "wp set"
msgstr "wp set"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:78
#: 5c2a5ef34afd43358f34cbf580b9768d
msgid ""
"The specified waypoint as the current waypoint. The mission will be run from"
" this waypoint onwards. If the autopilot is running in AUTO mode, it will go"
" to this waypoint immediately."
msgstr "将指定航点设为当前航点，任务将从此航点起继续执行。若飞控正在AUTO模式下运行，将立即飞往此航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:87
#: 54a49e09af8948ebb940db148c03e154
msgid "wp undo"
msgstr "wp undo"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:89
#: 5c07e5bebdfa48cda9ff9e77ccc867f6
msgid ""
"Reverts the last waypoint change or edit. Only the last change made via the "
"wp command can be undone."
msgstr "撤销最后一次航点更改或编辑。仅可撤销通过wp命令所做的最后一次更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:97
#: 9b000c10a3e9497e965be698a29f71cc
msgid "Using a GUI"
msgstr "使用图形界面"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/waypoints.rst:99
#: 6283722bd22d4e7f99985db9ffe65c80
msgid ""
"The map module includes methods for viewing and editing waypoints on a map."
msgstr "地图模块提供了在地图上查看和编辑航点的功能。"
